{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Vibes Plan 是一款人工智能旅遊規劃應用，適合想輕鬆安排週末短遊或長途旅程的人。它原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，可協助整理景點與每日行程，減少漫長的研究時間。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-204.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>智能行程規劃</h2>\n<p>Vibes Plan 以人工智能協助規劃旅遊行程，無論是週末短遊或長途旅程，都可代為整理目的地與日程，減少繁複研究。它可在下雨時改寫當日安排，並發掘熱門咖啡店與書店隱藏地點，讓有限時間集中於探索，而非反覆搜尋。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-227-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-228-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-229-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-171-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Vibes Plan</li><li>應用類別：Travel</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/vibes-plan/id6816105660?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T18:21:38.722210+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":246,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T17:54:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T19:12:42.557259+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T18:15:08.927616+00:00","content_hash":"4fee91d30ee5a543e89e2c00864e856bdebdfcc45bc8448a66c20b65a5056755","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T18:21:38.722210+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}